```
All 9 failures are `TypeError: Object of type date is not JSON serializable`, coming from `_save()` — i.e., every failure traces to the one blocked line above, nothing else. Once that line is applied, re-run the same command; I expect all 47 to pass (I have not been able to confirm this since I can't apply the fix myself).

